  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaL India - URMP Prayagraj, 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment focuses on the contribution of Water as Leverage to the Indian Urban River Management Plans (URMP) with a current focus on the URMP Prayagraj. The National Mission for Clean Ganga is the steering government body of the URMP framework. NMCG has assigned the National Institute of Urban Affairs (NIUA) to lead the UMRP Prayagraj process including the consultation sessions with the city of Prayagraj.</narrative>
  </description>
